"""Check recorded assemblies and suite partitions without ships or Hoon eval,
and the tools' own guards that need neither: golden case discovery, ship sync
verification against a fake ship, tools/check's interruption, doc-fragments,
browser-check.mjs and doc-format arguments, and manifest link closures.

Every check raises explicitly, so the checks also run under python -O."""

